    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.context.reactive\"><code>ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext</code></a> that accepts annotated classes as\ninput - in particular <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>-annotated classes, but also\nplain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a> classes and JSR-330 compliant classes using\n<code>javax.inject</code> annotations.",
      "translation": "接受注解类作为输入的<a href=\"ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.context.reactive\"><code>ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext</code></a>——特别是带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>注解的类，但也包括普通的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>类和使用<code>javax.inject</code>注解的符合 JSR-330 规范的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface to provide configuration for a reactive web application.",
      "translation": "用于为响应式 Web 应用程序提供配置的接口。",
      "count": 2
